 "chart_notes": [
  "total_revenue is net revenue, derived: 経常利益 + 営業経費 + credit costs. 経常収益 (gross ordinary income) is kept in revenue_tagged for reference.",
  "net_interest_income is derived (資金運用収益 - 資金調達費用); J-GAAP has no 資金利益 element.",
  "provision is credit costs (与信関係費用), the sum of the tagged parts: 貸倒引当金繰入額 + 貸出金償却 - 貸倒引当金戻入益 - 償却債権取立益. A net release is negative.",
  "noninterest_income is derived (net revenue - net interest income): fees, trust fees, trading, other business and other ordinary items, each net of its own expense.",
  "pretax_income includes extraordinary items (extraordinary_income, extraordinary_loss); a forecast normally sets them to zero.",
  "loans is 貸出金 before the allowance, as printed; loan_allowance is the single 貸倒引当金 line, which also covers assets other than loans.",
  "deposits is 預金 as printed; negotiable certificates of deposit (譲渡性預金) are the separate line negotiable_cds.",
  "cash is 現金預け金 (cash and due from banks). At some banks part of it is not a cash equivalent; the tie-out then uses the filing's own reconciliation note only if it foots, else flags.",
  "equity_parent is derived (株主資本 + その他の包括利益累計額); J-GAAP has no single equity-to-owners total."
